(text "REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n1. Only a regulated 5 V source enters J1; select one inverter supply. No parallel supplies.\n2. Three 24-pin ports carry signals only; no bus power or sensor supply on these ports.\n3. GND/AGND contact positions share controller GND. Different power reference domains require isolation.\n4. ABZ is provisionally 3.3 V single-ended. Do not connect 5 V / differential encoders directly.\n5. Connector mechanics, crystal loading, ESD/clamps and component procurement remain review items.\n6. PFC timing / ADC scheduling are not proven by this schematic. See design_review.md." (at 20.32 239 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1) ) (justify left top)) (uuid "61e08b8d-a0ba-5ae8-95ab-31f73396c439"))
